 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It can be, with some rules. It' usually happy if the regift is useful and not too similar to what they've already got. Then think about someone who loves candles, and get them a mix of their favourite scents. That's a good regift. Another idea is to regift personal items that people love. A nice pen, a nice towel, a nice little cookbook. Honestly, there isn't general rule. Just think about it. Would you be proud of me if I regifted this? If the answer is no, keep shopping. Okay?",
